DiscoveryConfig.description:
Config-driven discovery for adapters that support it. The *basket
definition* (which acts to find) lives here as per-doctype query strings;
the portal mechanics (request shape, facets) stay in the adapter.

DocumentProvision.description:
Leaf-level legal text, paragraph / subparagraph / point.

`text` remains the plain-text shadow for search / fallback rendering;
`blocks` is the rich AST built from the AKN sub-tree.
